      "title": "\u26a1 ApexForge \u2014 ACE-Step \u2014 Music Generation",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# \u26a1 ApexForge \u2014 ACE-Step \u2014 Music Generation\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udfe3 CheckpointLoaderSimple\n**Model:** `ace_step_v1_3.5b.safetensors`\n\ud83d\udcc1 **Location:** `ComfyUI/models/checkpoints/`\n> ~7 GB \u2014 generates music from text prompts\n\n---\n## \ud83e\udde9 Required Custom Nodes\n- None \u2014 all core nodes\n\n---\n## \ud83d\udca1 Tips\n- Describe genre, mood, instruments and vocals in the prompt\n- 120 seconds default \u2014 adjust EmptyAceStepLatentAudio length node\n- Use LoadAudio input for audio-conditional generation (remix/repaint modes)\n- Output saves as MP3, Opus, and WAV simultaneously\n\n---\n## \ud83d\udcda ApexForge\n\ud83d\ude80 **All models are pre-installed on your pod.**\n\ud83c\udfa8 **Just load this workflow and start generating.**"
      ],
      "color": "#231535",
      "bgcolor": "#3f2460"
    },
